abstract: >-
  A blind S0 / S1 / SN epistemic benchmarking specification and two-stage
  expected-value (EV) scoring protocol that isolates autonomous problem-state
  recognition (Underspecified, Convergent, Multi-Valid) before domain execution
  in large language models and multi-agent pipelines.

